quiz.question:
What will the following code output if age is set to 19?
```javascript
let age = 19;
if (age >= 18) {
    console.log('You can vote!');
} else {
    console.log('You are too young to vote.');
}
```

What will be the output of this code when day is set to 2?
```javascript
let day = 2;
switch (day) {
    case 1:
        console.log('Monday');
        break;
    case 2:
        console.log('Tuesday');
        break;
    default:
        console.log('Not a valid day');
}
```

What will be the output of this code when k is equal to 6?
```javascript
let k = 6;
do {
    console.log(k);
    k++; 
} while (k <= 5);
```

